{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53445","headline":"秋怀 · 滕倪","name":"秋怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嫋嫋芙蓉枝，灼灼当秋好。\n严霜一以冽，日夜色枯槁。\n讵惟华叶衰，柯条不自保。\n斩刈同束薪，秋江迹如扫。\n时事多推移，江流去浩浩。\n（见民国二十年戴鸿熙纂《汤溪县志》卷十九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"滕倪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}